 *
 * - ``void T_init(T *ptr)``: Initialize the data type. This is synonymous with
 *   zeroing out the memory, i.e. ``memset(ptr, 0, sizeof(T))``.
 * - ``T* T_new()``: Allocate and return the memory for the data type. The
